hts from their careers.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":367735,\"title\":\"John Mulaney: The Comeback Kid\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pzM9t33T2YUA7vaCb2GxaDrlTW1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8iTGzNjDAFsn2zZr6sdJ79GLp5K.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Armed with boyish charm and a sharp wit, the former \\\"SNL\\\" writer offers sly takes on marriage, his beef with babies and the time he met Bill Clinton.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":613999,\"title\":\"Aziz Ansari: Right Now\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5vaYOkQ3MxOnxQLeKUNXiAfZVHb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2QyZSGSGIGqeODxBc2ssltu4ldj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a comedy special directed by Spike Jonze, Aziz Ansari shares deep personal insights and hilarious takes on wokeness, family and the social climate.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13015,\"title\":\"George Carlin: Life Is Worth Losing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/djoek5ZJA1J7E6vD0jAoUN5Mqjb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7U3azp9x1eWEQKSYOIgksZ7ie40.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Carlin returns to the stage in his 13th live comedy stand-up special, performed at the Beacon Theatre in New York City for HBO®. His spot-on observations on the deterioration of human behavior include Americans’ obsession with their two favorite addictions - shopping and eating; his creative idea for The All-Suicide Channel, a new reality TV network; and the glorious rebirth of the planet to its original pristine condition - once the fires and floods destroy life as we know it.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":161803,\"title\":\"CM101MMXI Fundamentals\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nwmoYBOPJ2tLthK4z8rgfnHLu5D.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kQKJCku7vhz9Wce2PFm6ehWcBPh.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The funny little details of everyday life,  simple things that make us laugh.  An unforgettable performance from Cem Yilmaz.  Yilmaz captures the audience with his hilarious stories about relationships, humankind's struggle with the technology and professional life. Yilmaz proves us that a food delivery or even a funeral might be amusing when considered correctly.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1234282,\"title\":\"Wise Guys: The Lost Show\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ouerqMHpDETCj4tDXFiqni6ow0o.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During the COVID-19 pandemic, two college students set out to make a revolutionary television show. The pilot episode was uncovered and presented alongside exclusive interviews with the cast and crew.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270125,\"title\":\"State of Bacon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oAiaYaOXBwEzpCoErSam8SO6zwi.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"State of Bacon tells the kinda real but mostly fake tale of an oddball group of characters leading up to the annual Blue Ribbon Bacon Festival. Bacon-enthusiasts, Governor Branstad, a bacon queen, Hacksaw Jim Duggan, members of PETA, and an envoy of Icelanders are not excluded from this bacon party and during the course of the film become intertwined with the organizers of the festival to show that bacon diplomacy is not dead.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1438851,\"title\":\"Exquisite Corpse\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6WYiKjhNnleMXnx5rX4I8QxmIXf.jpg\",\"backdrop\